&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　(注) １．特定子会社であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　 ２．売上高(連結会社相互間の内部売上高を除く)の連結売上高に占める割合が10％を超えております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;主要な損益情報等  ①  売上高     　　 825百万円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:130.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;②  経常利益    　　 38〃&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:130.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;③  当期純利益   　  36〃&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:130.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;④  純資産額  　 　  93〃&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:130.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;⑤  総資産額 　　   202〃&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;       ３．有価証券報告書の提出会社であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock>
