&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:31.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;"&gt;(3) 【その他】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:31.5pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfOperationalProceduresForSharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
